            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acute Pain Units aim to apply effective methods for analgesic control, providing an organised and systematic health care adapted to each patient. The Acute Pain Unit Staff Nurse will put into effect high quality nursing care to the surgical patient through an interprofessional approach in the personalization, seamless care and postoperative acute pain treatment.</AbstractText>
